  "claim": "Love Thy Neighbor starred an American actor who was best known for his role as Jack Tripper in the sitcom Three's Company.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Love Thy Neighbor (1984 film). Sentence: Love Thy Neighbor is a 1984 American made-for-television romantic comedy film starring John Ritter, Penny Marshall, Cassie Yates, Bert Convy and Constance McCashin.\nPage: John Ritter. Sentence: Jonathan Southworth Ritter (September 17, 1948 – September 11, 2003) was an American actor and comedian.\nPage: John Ritter. Sentence: The son of the late singing cowboy star Tex Ritter and the father of actors Jason Ritter and Tyler Ritter, he was best known for his role as Jack Tripper on the ABC sitcom \"Three's Company\" (1977–84), for which he received a Primetime Emmy Award and a Golden Globe Award in 1984.",
